2026-05-27 11:45:06,427 | AGENT | SecurityCompliance Agent answered: To meet the tender's security requirements, I propose leveraging our existing certifications and experience. Since we have experience with SecNumCloud projects, having completed 3 such projects, and are familiar with EU-based hosting, we can ensure that our infrastructure meets the required standards.

For GDPR compliance, our company has a appointed Data Protection Officer, and we maintain standard data residency within the EU. We also enforce strict cross-border transfer policies, prohibiting transfers unless there's an explicit legal basis. Our anonymisation tools, including Microsoft Presidio and custom NER models, will ensure that personal data is properly protected.

To address explicability and transparency of AI recommendations, our AI security controls include output PII redaction, adversarial input detection, and confidence threshold escalation. These measures will help ensure the integrity and reliability of the AI-powered system.

Additionally, we can implement Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) design principles to restrict access to sensitive data and systems, and utilize Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) methods such as TOTP or hardware tokens (FIDO2) to secure user access. Our network security architecture will follow zero-trust, micro-segmentation, and defence-in-depth patterns to minimize potential risks.

We will also conduct regular Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs) with an average duration of 3 weeks to identify and mitigate any data protection risks associated with the solution. Furthermore, our incident response plan includes a Security Incident Response Team (SIRT) and playbooks for prompt breach notification within the required 72-hour delay.

Lastly, we can provide real-time SIEM integration using tools like Wazuh or Elastic SIEM, ensuring that all security-related events are properly monitored and logged. Our log immutability method using append-only with SHA-256 hash chaining guarantees the integrity of our audit logs, which are retained for 7 years.
